Package: lab5
Title: Access and Visualise Data from the Nobel Prize API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Anh", "Tran", , "anhtr209@student.liu.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    person("Tatevik", "Hakobyan", , "tatha821@student.liu.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to download data on Nobel Prize laureates from the official Nobel Prize API <https://api.nobelprize.org/2.1> and to visualise it, including maps of laureates' birth countries and plots of laureates' age at the time of the award. A Shiny app is included for exploring the data interactively.
